 "text": "Resources for Businesses | Clay County, MO\nPress Alt+1 for screen-reader mode, Alt+0 to cancel Accessibility Screen-Reader Guide, Feedback, and Issue Reporting | New window\nLoading\nSkip to Main Content\nCreate a Website Account - Manage notification subscriptions, save form progress and more.\nWebsite Sign In\nGovernment\nDepartments\nResidents\nBusinesses\nCommunity\nSearch\nHome\nDepartments\nCounty Assessor\nPersonal Property\nResources for Businesses\nResources for Businesses\nThe Assessor is responsible for the valuation of all taxable property in the County. Every person owning or holding tangible personal property on the first day of January, including all such property purchased on that day, shall be liable for taxes thereon during the same calendar year. The political subdivisions, a.k.a. taxing jurisdictions (school districts, rural fire districts, the county library, etc.) are responsible for setting the tax rates necessary to generate the revenue needed to fund their operations. Property tax rates are set by September 1st of every year.\nMissouri's property tax continues to be the largest and most reliable source of funding for the State's local governments, with approximately two-thirds of the taxes collected going to local schools. An efficient, professional assessment program ensures that this stable, steady revenue source is not only maintained but also that it is implemented in a fair and equitable fashion.\nBusiness Personal Property Registration Form\nThis is not your assessment.\nBusiness Personal Property Assessment Forms\n2026 Forms 2026 Business Pers. Property Assessment Form A (PDF)\n2026 Form A Cover Letter (PDF)\n2025 Forms 2025 Business Pers. Property Assessment Form A (PDF)\n2025 Form A Cover Letter (PDF)\n2024 Forms 2024 Business Pers. Property Assessment Form A (PDF)\n2024 Form A Cover Letter (PDF)\n2023 Forms 2023 Business Pers. Property Assessment Form A (PDF)\n2023 Form A Cover Letter (PDF)\nQuick Links\nBusiness Personal Property Registration Form\nProperty Taxes\nInformation\nAgendas, Meetings & Videos\nKeep Informed\nNotify Me®\nReceive The Latest Information\nReport A Problem\nLet Us Know\nEmployment\nCurrent Openings\nParks\nInformation & Reservations\n-->\nQuick Links\nHome\nFAQs\nNews\n/QuickLinks.aspx\nSite Links\nSite Map\nCopyright Notices\nMobile\nAccessibility\nPrivacy Policy\n/QuickLinks.aspx\nFollow Us!\nContact\nPhone: 816-407-3600\n1 Courthouse Sq. Liberty, MO 64068\nGovernment Websites by CivicPlus®\nLoading\nLoading\nDo Not Show Again\nClose\nClose ×",
